  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The factors of \\(x^4+64\\) are:",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\((x^2+8)^2\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\((x^2+8)(x^2-8)\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\((x^2+2x+4)(x^2-8x+16)\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\((x^2-4x+8)(x^2-4x-8)\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\((x^2-4x+8)(x^2+4x+8)\\)"
    }
  ],
  "answer": {
    "letter": "e",
    "value": null
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1954-p32.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Using a difference of squares, \\[ \\begin{aligned} x^4+64 &=(x^2+8)^2-16x^2\\\\ &=(x^2-4x+8)\\\\ &\\quad{}\\cdot(x^2+4x+8). \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Add and subtract \\(16x^2\\) to form a difference of squares",
        "Write \\(x^4+64=(x^2+8)^2-(4x)^2\\)"
      ],
      "images": []
    }
  ],
